{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52811","headline":"题滑州公府大厅梁上（题拟） · 李邕","name":"题滑州公府大厅梁上（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大厦中构，山屹云斗。\n黄河畎浍，太行培塿。\n整庶宣风，缉戎备寇。\n镇宁一方，光辅元后。\n（见民国二十一年铅印本王蒲园等纂《重修滑县志》卷十二《金石》录宋赵世长《天禧二年滑州公府大厅记》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李邕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52811.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52811","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}